package dev.snowflake.vulkan

/** In-app reference only; metric collection and HUD rendering remain native. */
internal data class MetricHelp(val id: String, val titleEn: String, val titleZh: String, val english: String, val chinese: String)

internal val metricHelp = listOf(
    MetricHelp("legend", "Reading the HUD", "如何读懂悬浮窗",
        "FPS and Pre show a recent average, with [minimum maximum] from retained frame intervals. The blue curve shows presentation intervals. GPU units depend on the sampling source; GPU batch/window values are not aligned with individual displayed frames. Mem uses a different bracket meaning, explained below.",
        "FPS、Pre 的主数值是近期均值，[最小值 最大值] 来自保留的帧间隔历史。蓝色曲线表示呈现间隔。GPU 单位取决于采样来源，批次或窗口耗时不能与每个显示帧一一对应。Mem 方括号的含义不同，见下方说明。"),
    MetricHelp("fps", "FPS · Frame rate", "FPS · 帧率",
        "Frames presented per second, derived from the game's SurfaceFlinger presentation timestamps. Higher generally looks smoother, but a stable frame interval also matters. The classic HUD averages up to 120 recent intervals; it is not the display refresh rate or an engine frame counter.",
        "每秒呈现的帧数，根据游戏图层的实际呈现时间戳计算。通常越高越流畅，但帧间隔稳定性同样重要。经典 HUD 最多使用最近 120 个间隔计算均值，不等于屏幕刷新率，也不是引擎内部帧计数。"),
    MetricHelp("frame_time", "Pre · Presentation interval", "Pre · 呈现间隔",
        "Time between consecutive presented frames, in ms. 60 FPS corresponds to about 16.67 ms; 120 FPS to 8.33 ms. Lower and steadier is smoother. This is not CPU rendering time, GPU execution time, or touch-to-display latency.",
        "相邻两帧实际呈现之间的时间，单位 ms（毫秒）。60 FPS 约为 16.67 ms，120 FPS 约为 8.33 ms；越低且越稳定越流畅。它不是 CPU 渲染耗时、GPU 执行耗时，也不是触控到显示的总延迟。"),
    MetricHelp("gpu_time", "GPU · Execution time", "GPU · 执行耗时",
        "ms/batch means GPU active time per command batch reported by the driver. ms/window means GPU active time reported for the same Android UID during a sampling window (the window length is shown). A UID can contain several processes. Neither is necessarily per-frame GPU render time; a small value does not prove the GPU is idle.",
        "ms/batch 表示驱动报告的每个命令批次的 GPU 活跃耗时；ms/window 表示一个采样窗口内、同一 Android UID 的 GPU 活跃耗时，窗口长度会单独显示。一个 UID 可能包含多个进程。这两者都不一定是每帧 GPU 渲染耗时，数值很小也不能证明 GPU 没有工作。"),
    MetricHelp("app_memory", "Mem · Process memory", "Mem · 进程内存",
        "Memory resident in RAM (RSS) for the game's main process, in MB. It includes resident shared pages and is not the game's private heap or the sum of all child processes. In the HUD, Mem's bracketed number is GPU shared memory, not a min/max range.",
        "游戏主进程当前驻留在物理内存中的数据（RSS），单位 MB，包含驻留的共享页面。它不等于私有堆大小，也不包含所有子进程的合计。HUD 中 Mem 后的方括号表示 GPU 共享内存，不是最小/最大值。"),
    MetricHelp("gpu_memory", "GPU memory · Mem brackets", "GPU 内存 · Mem 方括号",
        "KGSL driver allocations plus proportional imported buffers attributable to the main process, in decimal MB. Phones share system RAM with the GPU; this is not desktop-style dedicated VRAM, and should not be added to RSS as a total because accounting can overlap.",
        "归属于游戏主进程的 KGSL 驱动分配及按比例计算的导入缓冲区，单位十进制 MB。手机 GPU 使用共享系统内存，不是电脑独立显卡的专用显存；与 RSS 的统计可能重叠，不能直接相加当作总占用。"),
    MetricHelp("frame_p95", "P95 · Frame interval", "P95 · 帧间隔",
        "95% of sampled presentation intervals are at or below this value (ms). A high P95 relative to the average suggests uneven frame delivery or stutter. It is a percentile, not the slowest frame.",
        "采样中 95% 的呈现间隔不超过该值，单位 ms。P95 明显高于平均间隔，说明可能存在帧输出不均匀或卡顿。它是百分位数，不是最慢一帧。"),
    MetricHelp("graphics_api", "Graphics API", "图形 API",
        "OpenGL ES or Vulkan is confirmed only when relevant calls are captured. Loaded: means libraries were found, but active calls are unconfirmed; both libraries can be loaded together. Root does not guarantee kernel probe support. This does not identify a DirectX version above a translation layer.",
        "捕获到相关调用后才能确认 OpenGL ES 或 Vulkan。Loaded: 仅表示发现已加载库，尚未确认实际调用；两种库也可能同时加载。Root 不保证内核支持探针。这项不会识别转换层之上的 DirectX 版本。"),
    MetricHelp("foreground", "App · Foreground application", "App · 前台应用",
        "Package currently identified as foreground. The sampling target follows this package and its Android user. A launcher or a different app means the sample is not for your previous game.",
        "当前识别到的前台应用包名。采样目标随包名和 Android 用户切换；若显示桌面或其他应用，当前样本就不是此前的游戏。"),
    MetricHelp("fps_source", "FPS source", "帧率来源",
        "Identifies the presentation timestamp source and any sampling error. SurfaceFlinger actual-present describes system-observed presentation, not direct engine instrumentation.",
        "说明呈现时间戳的来源和采样错误。SurfaceFlinger actual-present 表示系统观察到的实际呈现，不是直接读取引擎内部计数器。"),
    MetricHelp("surface", "Surface · Game layer", "Surface · 游戏图层",
        "The game layer used for frame timing. A container, input layer, or layer with only zero/pending timestamps cannot provide a valid FPS sample.",
        "用于读取帧时间的游戏图层。容器层、输入层或只返回零值/待完成时间戳的图层，无法提供有效帧率。"),
    MetricHelp("gpu_model", "GPU model", "GPU 型号", "Hardware GPU name; it does not indicate the game's active API.", "GPU 硬件名称，不能据此判断游戏正在使用的图形 API。"),
    MetricHelp("gpu_driver", "GPU driver", "GPU 驱动", "Driver version reported by Vulkan. A raw number may use a vendor-specific encoding.", "Vulkan 报告的驱动版本。原始数字可能采用厂商专用编码。"),
    MetricHelp("gpu_api", "Supported Vulkan version", "设备支持的 Vulkan 版本", "Vulkan capability reported by the device. This does not mean the current game uses Vulkan or this version.", "设备报告的 Vulkan 支持能力，不代表当前游戏使用 Vulkan 或该版本。"),
    MetricHelp("cpu_freq", "CPU clock", "CPU 频率", "Current CPU clock per available CPU/policy, in MHz. Frequency changes with workload, power policy and temperature; it is not utilization.", "可读取的 CPU 核心或频率策略组的当前频率，单位 MHz。它随负载、功耗策略和温度变化，不等于 CPU 使用率。"),
    MetricHelp("cpu_load", "CPU utilization", "CPU 使用率", "System-wide utilization across all CPU cores over the sampling interval, in percent. This is not the foreground game's CPU usage alone.", "采样间隔内所有 CPU 核心的整机使用率，单位 %，不是前台游戏单独占用的 CPU 比例。"),
    MetricHelp("cpu_power", "CPU power sensor", "CPU 功率传感器", "Watts calculated from the configured sensor path and scale. Availability and what the sensor measures depend on the device; an arbitrary path does not establish CPU-only power.", "根据配置的传感器路径及倍率换算为瓦特（W）。可用性及传感器统计范围取决于设备；随意指定路径不能保证读到的是 CPU 独立功耗。"),
    MetricHelp("gpu_freq", "GPU clock", "GPU 频率", "Current GPU clock in MHz when the driver exposes it. This describes frequency, not busy time or utilization.", "驱动可提供时读取的当前 GPU 频率，单位 MHz。它表示频率，不是忙碌时间或使用率。"),
    MetricHelp("gpu_load", "GPU utilization", "GPU 使用率", "Busy/total counter ratio exposed by a supported Adreno driver, in percent. This is device GPU activity, not just the game's share.", "支持的 Adreno 驱动提供的 busy/total 计数比例，单位 %。这是设备 GPU 的活动情况，不是游戏独占的比例。"),
    MetricHelp("memory", "System RAM", "系统内存", "Available and total system RAM. Available memory includes memory the system can reclaim, and is different from unused/free memory.", "系统可用内存与总内存。可用内存包含系统可回收的部分，不等于完全未使用的空闲内存。"),
    MetricHelp("battery_power", "Battery power", "电池功率", "Whole-device estimate from battery voltage and current, in watts. It is not game-only or CPU/GPU-only power; charging and sensor precision affect interpretation.", "由电池电压和电流估算的整机功率，单位 W。不是游戏单独功耗，也不是 CPU/GPU 独立功耗；充电状态和传感器精度会影响解读。"),
    MetricHelp("battery_temp", "Battery temperature", "电池温度", "Battery sensor temperature in °C. It is not the CPU or GPU junction temperature.", "电池传感器温度，单位 °C，不是 CPU 或 GPU 芯片结温。"),
    MetricHelp("thermal", "Thermal pressure", "系统热状态", "Android's reported thermal pressure level. None means no reported thermal pressure, not zero temperature or guaranteed absence of throttling.", "Android 报告的热压力等级。None 表示未报告热压力，不是温度为零，也不能保证完全没有降频。"),
    MetricHelp("display_resolution", "Display resolution", "屏幕分辨率", "Resolution of the display mode. Rotation can swap width and height; it does not establish the game's internal rendering resolution.", "屏幕显示模式的分辨率，旋转可能改变宽高顺序。不能据此确定游戏内部渲染分辨率。"),
    MetricHelp("display_refresh", "Display refresh", "屏幕刷新率", "Display refresh rate in Hz. A 120 Hz screen can still display a game running at 60 FPS or lower.", "屏幕刷新率，单位 Hz。即使屏幕为 120 Hz，游戏仍可能只有 60 FPS 或更低。"),
    MetricHelp("engine_name", "Game engine", "游戏引擎", "Identified from known engine libraries loaded by the target process, such as libunity.so for Unity. Unknown means insufficient evidence; multiple signatures are reported together.", "根据目标进程加载的已知引擎库识别，例如 libunity.so 对应 Unity。Unknown 表示证据不足；出现多种特征时会一并报告。"),
    MetricHelp("engine_resolution", "Engine render size", "引擎内部渲染分辨率", "Rendering size before upscaling, only when a compatible engine report/reader is available. Identifying Unity does not automatically make this measurement available.", "升采样前的内部渲染尺寸，需要兼容的引擎报告或读取器。识别出 Unity 不代表自动获得这个尺寸。"),
    MetricHelp("engine_output", "Engine output size", "引擎输出分辨率", "Output size reported by a compatible engine integration. This may differ from internal render size and screen resolution.", "兼容引擎集成报告的输出尺寸，可能与内部渲染尺寸及屏幕分辨率不同。"),
    MetricHelp("engine_source", "Engine evidence", "引擎识别与数据来源", "Shows engine identification evidence or the validated telemetry source, plus target process/version information when available.", "显示引擎识别依据或经过校验的遥测来源，以及可读取的目标进程和版本信息。"),
    MetricHelp("availability", "Unavailable and old samples", "缺失值与旧样本",
        "-- / N/A means no valid measurement; OFF means disabled. Neither means zero. Last sample: …s ago; refreshing marks retained old data while the next sample is pending; it is not a new measurement. Sampling timestamps and errors are available in game diagnostics.",
        "-- / N/A 表示没有有效测量值，OFF 表示已关闭，都不代表零。Last sample: …s ago; refreshing 表示等待下一轮时保留的旧数据，不是新测量结果。采样时间和错误原因可在游戏诊断中查看。")
)
